   0188 makes Back at an app's root show Active Frames in the SableOS home, as Home does (2.0 plan, BB10): `patch_back_to_frames` adds `SableBackToFrames` (unit-tested), which notes as the home stops whether another app took the screen (REAL_GET_TASKS) and shows Active Frames when the home comes back for that reason; returning from the home's own screens or from screen off changes nothing.
